---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../site.config';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description={`How ${site.name} handles information you share through this website.`} robots="noindex,follow" hideFooterCta>
  <div class="container prose" style="padding-block: var(--s2)">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <!-- SETUP: Jason reviews this. It describes what the site actually does. If he adds tools (GA4, Meta Pixel, an online booking tool), the wizard updates it. -->
    <p><em>Last updated: 2026-09-28</em></p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you send a message through the contact form, we receive the name, email, phone number, and message you type. It is emailed to the shop so we can reply to you. The website itself doesn't store it.</p>
    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>This site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics, which does not use cookies and does not track you across sites. It tells us which pages people visit so we can improve the site.</p>
    <h2>Third-party content</h2>
    <p>Some pages load content from other companies: Google Fonts (the typeface) and, where shown, Google Maps (the map). Those services may record that your browser loaded them, under their own privacy policies.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>Want us to delete your information? Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and we will.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
